     1,
     "Apologies. My finger slipped!<div><br></div><div>I just wanted to know how the MissingPercentage column is calculated, please. When I have a percentage of 0.5, I thought that for a protein, abundances in half of the samples of a comparison were missing. However, when I check the sampleQuant file, this is not the case. Also, when I have a situation where I have 3 vs 3 in a comparison, I expect the possible missing values to be 0.167 (1/6), 0.33 (2/6), 0.5 (3/6), 0.67 (4/6), 0.83 (5/6) or 1. This happens when I impute. Could you explain what is going on, please?</div><div><br></div><div>Best wishes,</div><div>Amandeep</div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "WhxysRRmAAAJ",
