     1,
     "Hi,<div><br></div><div>MissingPercentage is a metric that is peptide specific for a particular run.  For example, in this table below, run 1 for peptide ATDVIVPEEGELR has a 0% missingPercentage because it has measurements on all 6 features, but run 2 has a 33% missingPercentage for peptide ATDVIVPEEGELR because it has measurements on only 4 of 6 features.  </div><div><br></div><div>Feature      |         Run          |       MissingPercentage </div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Verdana,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px\">ATDVIVPEEGELR_2_y6 | 1 | 0%</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Verdana,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px\">ATDVIVPEEGELR_2_y7</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Verdana,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Verdana,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px\">| 1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Verdana,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Verdana,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px\">| </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Verdana,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px\">0%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Verdana,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Ve